{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BPROOF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BPROOF is a tactical survival game in which survival, quick decisions, and adaptation make the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wave Mode \u2013 The Basics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Wave Mode allows players to face successive waves of enemies, either solo or in multiplayer. Each wave becomes stronger, faster, or more tactically demanding. Between waves, points can be used to acquire new weapons, obtain healing, or secure strategic advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement, dodging, and precise aiming are essential. The available space on the map and the selected enemy types strongly influence gameplay. Wave Mode serves as an introduction to BPROOF and conveys the core mechanics of combat, survival, and pressure situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wave Mode, weapons are still <strong>randomly available via machines</strong>. Health and ammunition purchases are also already possible here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scenario Mode \u2013 New Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Scenario Mode, BPROOF expands with a new way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the focus is no longer just on surviving waves, but on <strong>finding a way out of the level and escaping</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find various <strong>objects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >complete specific <strong>tasks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >actively move through the level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of classic waves, players face <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> that block their path and constantly create pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Systems in Scenario Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find weapons in the level</strong><br>In Scenario Mode, weapons are no longer randomly available via machines, but must be discovered in the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing Machine</strong><br>Restore your health by spending points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ammo Machine</strong><br>Purchase ammunition as needed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These systems increase the focus on <strong>exploration, planning, and resource management</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Direction of BPROOF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Mode is a first step in a new direction.<br>BPROOF is evolving into a <strong>tactical survival experience with different scenarios, objectives, and playstyles</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Match ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/cd0444234e148ed573fab012a742fbe28800c263.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 50s","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/41256a1e0622c027159ffe65adc5ed9b2a676246.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/b0bb3b95651125f7d931659c0a59b6eeb90bad94.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/65e7781312c92a98fc17c33dde666101edb671c0.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/d3f47ad3987b04b1338ff7d67ffcaf53f27d37d5.jpg"},{"name":"Weaponmen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/366bbe503ef3cd988bdc2e4e117d619a90e18603.jpg"},{"name":"Bulletproof","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/1bc9111f1999749c88939e12150eeee280d4d85d.jpg"},{"name":"Yeehaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/ad7ab0f46a9cd645348ef23e5c978d9d7848d2fb.jpg"},{"name":"claustrophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/6320adcde1742a2c2ef9564f5f0419ff264e6e09.jpg"},{"name":"Deep in the Woods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/9d9b287abbf12e305e4fed75c14920e1ddefa441.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838660?t=1773949460","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838660/d16c9c207e873293d1cb73e685f1eebe48c7419c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773949460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838660/012f68cf37475b4626e5448ce18167ca4f90fc7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773949460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838660/012f68cf37475b4626e5448ce18167ca4f90fc7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773949460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Explicit Violence\r\nShock and/or Horror Content"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BPROOF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BPROOF is a tactical survival game in which survival, quick decisions, and adaptation make the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wave Mode \u2013 The Basics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Wave Mode allows players to face successive waves of enemies, either s