rease the focus on <strong>exploration, planning, and resource management</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Direction of BPROOF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Mode is a first step in a new direction.<br>BPROOF is evolving into a <strong>tactical survival experience with different scenarios, objectives, and playstyles</strong>.</p>","developers":["Dexsolutions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838660/7d900cdc98e2a1ea43915f858e22f9c371425e36/header.jpg?t=1773949460","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838660/487418938/004c3c353aceaa3fbff334457e4a83c05d976c0c/1772790196/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772791236","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838660/487418938/004c3c353aceaa3fbff334457e4a83c05d976c0c/1772790196/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772791236","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838660/487418938/004c3c353aceaa3fbff334457e4a83c05d976c0c/1772790196/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772791236","id":257298818,"name":"PATCH 1.7.5.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257298818/9c38b50701c5b26dbc74ee7a764a88a7a60b4923/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772791236"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838660/1102808388/2511767a329031c190f79fccd22c26955f323030/1763212158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763495722","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/383